cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Awesome AI Literature Review Agents & Tools"
abstract: >-
  A curated, continuously verified catalogue of open-source AI agents, skills,
  MCP servers and frameworks for literature review, covering every stage from
  search and screening through extraction, synthesis, citation checking and
  writing. Published as a machine-readable dataset alongside health and licence
  metadata refreshed weekly from the GitHub API, and a set of workflows executed
  end to end rather than described.
message: "If you use this catalogue or its dataset in your research, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Bryce
    website: "https://github.com/brycewang-stanford"
repository-code: "https://github.com/brycewang-stanford/lit-review-agent-tools"
url: "https://brycewang-stanford.github.io/lit-review-agent-tools/"
license: CC0-1.0
keywords:
  - literature review
  - systematic review
  - research software
  - large language models
  - AI agents
  - Model Context Protocol
  - PRISMA
  - open science
